WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.441
Inspect what the person needs before choosing and beginning.

00:00:04.441 --> 00:00:10.856
State the approved price or internal service expectations, scope, included support and exclusions.

00:00:10.856 --> 00:00:17.765
No actual price is supplied in this fictional case, so approval remains a dependency.

00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:27.141
Identify the authorized payment route only if relevant; do not configure settings or collect sensitive payment information for practice.

00:00:27.141 --> 00:00:35.036
Replace the vague delivery message with a named guide, a designated message and a labeled link.

00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:37.504
State participation and review expectations.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:47.373
Twenty minutes for one practice and one business day for an initial support acknowledgment are scenario assumptions, not verified promises.

00:00:47.373 --> 00:00:52.801
Identify the delivery owner, approved support route and human correction process.

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:58.723
Include readable instructions, privacy, feedback and any access conditions that remain unchecked.
